# ⚡ Parallel Chain in LangChain

This project demonstrates **Parallel Chains** in LangChain.

Instead of executing tasks one after another, multiple tasks run simultaneously.

---

# 📌 Objective

Given a text:

- Generate notes
- Generate quiz questions
- Merge both into one document

---

# 🧠 Workflow

```

Input Text
|
+----------------------+
| |
v v
Notes Chain Quiz Chain
| |
+----------+-----------+
|
v
Merge Chain
|
v
Final Document

```

---

# 📂 Project Structure

```

parallel_chain.py
README.md

```

