# 📦 Installation

```bash
pip install langchain langchain-openai langchain-anthropic python-dotenv
```

---

# ⚙️ Workflow Explanation

## Step 1

Generate Notes

```
Prompt
↓
OpenAI
↓
Notes
```

---

## Step 2

Generate Quiz

```
Prompt
↓
Claude
↓
Quiz
```

---

## Step 3

Run Both Together

```python
RunnableParallel({
    "notes": ...,
    "quiz": ...
})
```

Both chains execute simultaneously.

---

## Step 4

Merge Results

```
Notes
+
Quiz
↓
Merge Prompt
↓
OpenAI
↓
Final Document
```

---

# 📈 Architecture

```
                Input Text
                     │
      ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
      ▼                             ▼
 Generate Notes             Generate Quiz
      │                             │
      ▼                             ▼
     Notes                        Quiz
            └──────────┬───────────┘
                       ▼
                 Merge Prompt
                       ▼
                    OpenAI
                       ▼
                 Final Output
```

